\title{Local Parallel Mock SLURM Scheduler Backend}
\description{
Full-featured local SLURM array simulator that executes the exact generated
\code{worker.R} script in isolated background R processes via \code{processx},
throttled by a configurable concurrency queue (\code{max_workers}). Supports live
OS RSS polling via \code{ps}, disk-based atomic chunk checkpoints, real or
simulated \code{FAILED} / \code{OUT_OF_MEMORY} / \code{TIMEOUT} / \code{CANCELLED} states,
surgical retry of failed chunks, cancellation, log inspection, and ordered
result collection — enabling 100\% offline development and testing on a laptop.
}
